Short:        SAS/C V6.55 bug fix for SAS/C 6.50 / 6.51.
Author:       SAS Institute Inc.
Uploader:     jamie unx sas com
Type:         dev/c
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

This is a set of binary patches for the Amiga SAS/C Development System
with C++, Version 6.50, and the first patch to that version, Version 6.51.
It requires the original six-disk set that came with the SAS/C Development
System with C++ package.  It does NOT require the 6.51 patch disk, or that
the 6.51 patch be applied before this.	This single patch will bring
whichever version of 6.5x you have up to Version 6.55.

This patch is freely redistributable; further information can be found in
the archive in the file marked README.

NOTE:  This is the final patch which will be distributed for the Amiga
SAS/C Development System with C++.  Please spread this patch to every
system you normally call, so it may reach as many people as possible.
This patch will ONLY be distributed electronically.
